PROJECT: Aptos

## Ecosystem Position
- Kategori Ekosistem: Layer 1 Smart Contract Platform
- Primary Sector: Infrastructure / Base Layer
- Secondary Sector: DeFi, Gaming, NFT, Social, Move Ecosystem
- Primary Chain: Aptos (Mainnet)
- Supported Chains: Aptos Mainnet, Aptos Testnet, Aptos Devnet
- Sources:
  - Sumber: Aptos Labs Website, https://aptoslabs.com/ (HIGH)
  - Sumber: Aptos Dev Docs Network, https://aptos.dev/nodes/networks (HIGH)

## External Dependencies
- Dependency Name: Move Language Foundation | Dependency Type: Protocol | Purpose: Standar dan evolusi bahasa pemrograman Move (VM, Compiler, Prover) yang menjadi inti eksekusi Aptos. | Criticality: Critical | Status: Live | Related Entity: Move Language | Related Technology Component: Move VM | Sources: Move Language GitHub, https://github.com/move-language/move (HIGH)
- Dependency Name: Wormhole | Dependency Type: Bridge | Purpose: Cross-chain messaging dan asset bridging (ETH, Solana, BSC, dll) ke Aptos. | Criticality: High | Status: Live | Related Entity: Wormhole | Related Technology Component: Bridge / Messaging Layer | Sources: Wormhole Aptos Blog, https://wormhole.com/blog/aptos-mainnet-launch (HIGH)
- Dependency Name: LayerZero | Dependency Type: Bridge | Purpose: Omnichain interoperability (OFT, messaging) menghubungkan Aptos ke 40+ chain. | Criticality: High | Status: Live | Related Entity: LayerZero | Related Technology Component: Bridge / Messaging Layer | Sources: LayerZero Blog Aptos, https://layerzero.network/blog/aptos-mainnet (HIGH)
- Dependency Name: Google Cloud | Dependency Type: Cloud / Infrastructure | Purpose: Blockchain Node Engine (Managed Validator/Full Node), Validator operator. | Criticality: High | Status: Live | Related Entity: Google Cloud | Related Technology Component: Infrastructure Provider / Validator | Sources: Google Cloud Blockchain Node Engine, https://cloud.google.com/blockchain-node-engine/docs/aptos (HIGH)
- Dependency Name: Amazon Web Services (AWS) | Dependency Type: Cloud / Infrastructure | Purpose: Amazon Managed Blockchain (AMB) untuk RPC & Validator Node. | Criticality: High | Status: Live | Related Entity: Amazon Web Services (AWS) | Related Technology Component: Infrastructure Provider / RPC | Sources: AWS Managed Blockchain Aptos, https://aws.amazon.com/managed-blockchain/aptos/ (HIGH)
- Dependency Name: NodeReal | Dependency Type: Infrastructure | Purpose: RPC Provider, Indexer (AptosScan), Node Operator. | Criticality: High | Status: Live | Related Entity: NodeReal | Related Technology Component: Indexer / RPC | Sources: NodeReal Aptos, https://www.nodereal.io/aptos (HIGH)
- Dependency Name: Ankr | Dependency Type: Infrastructure | Purpose: RPC Provider, Staking Infrastructure. | Criticality: Medium | Status: Live | Related Entity: Ankr | Related Technology Component: RPC / Staking | Sources: Ankr Aptos RPC, https://www.ankr.com/rpc/aptos/ (HIGH)
- Dependency Name: QuickNode | Dependency Type: Infrastructure | Purpose: High-performance RPC Endpoint Provider. | Criticality: Medium | Status: Live | Related Entity: QuickNode | Related Technology Component: RPC | Sources: QuickNode Aptos, https://www.quicknode.com/chains/aptos (HIGH)
- Dependency Name: Pyth Network | Dependency Type: Oracle | Purpose: Price Feeds (Pull Oracle) untuk DeFi di Aptos. | Criticality: High | Status: Live | Related Entity: Pyth Network | Related Technology Component: Oracle | Sources: Pyth Network Aptos, https://pyth.network/developers/price-feed-ids#aptos (HIGH)
- Dependency Name: Switchboard | Dependency Type: Oracle | Purpose: Customizable Oracle / VRF / Price Feeds untuk Aptos. | Criticality: Medium | Status: Live | Related Entity: Switchboard | Related Technology Component: Oracle / VRF | Sources: Switchboard Aptos Docs, https://docs.switchboard.xyz/aptos (HIGH)
- Dependency Name: Celestia (Data Availability) | Dependency Type: Protocol | Purpose: Eksplorasi Data Availability layer modular (Masih riset/integrasi awal, bukan dependency produksi kritis). | Criticality: Low | Status: Planned / Research | Related Entity: Celestia | Related Technology Component: Data Availability | Sources: Aptos Foundation Research Grants, https://aptosfoundation.org/grants (MEDIUM)
- Dependency Name: Rust Toolchain / Cargo | Dependency Type: SDK / Toolchain | Purpose: Bahasa dan build system utama untuk Core Node (aptos-core). | Criticality: Critical | Status: Live | Related Entity: Rust Foundation | Related Technology Component: Core Client | Sources: Rust Lang, https://www.rust-lang.org/ (HIGH)

## Major Integrations
- Integration Name: Wormhole Cross-Chain Bridge | Integrated With: Wormhole | Purpose: Transfer aset (WETH, USDC, USDT) & pesan lintas chain ke Ethereum, Solana, BNB Chain, dll. | Status: Live | Related Historical Event ID: EV-013 | Sources: Wormhole Blog, https://wormhole.com/blog/aptos-mainnet-launch (HIGH)
- Integration Name: LayerZero Omnichain Messaging | Integrated With: LayerZero | Purpose: OFT Standard, pesan arbitrer, Stargate Bridge liquidity. | Status: Live | Related Historical Event ID: EV-014 | Sources: LayerZero Blog, https://layerzero.network/blog/aptos-mainnet (HIGH)
- Integration Name: Google Cloud Blockchain Node Engine | Integrated With: Google Cloud | Purpose: Managed Validator & Full Node Service (1-click deploy). | Status: Live | Related Historical Event ID: EV-016 | Sources: Google Cloud Blog, https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/web3/google-cloud-blockchain-node-engine-aptos (HIGH)
- Integration Name: AWS Managed Blockchain (AMB) | Integrated With: Amazon Web Services (AWS) | Purpose: Managed RPC Access & Validator Node. | Status: Live | Related Historical Event ID: EV-020 | Sources: AWS Blog, https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2024/03/amazon-managed-blockchain-aptos/ (HIGH)
- Integration Name: Pyth Network Price Feeds | Integrated With: Pyth Network | Purpose: Real-time price feeds untuk DeFi (Thala, Aries, Cellana). | Status: Live | Related Historical Event ID: EV-018 (Ecosystem Growth Context) | Sources: Pyth Docs Aptos, https://pyth.network/developers/price-feed-ids#aptos (HIGH)
- Integration Name: Switchboard Oracle & VRF | Integrated With: Switchboard | Purpose: Custom oracle queues & VRF untuk Gaming/DeFi. | Status: Live | Related Historical Event ID: EV-018 | Sources: Switchboard Docs, https://docs.switchboard.xyz/aptos (HIGH)
- Integration Name: Circle USDC Native | Integrated With: Circle | Purpose: Native USDC mint/redeem di Aptos (Bukan bridged). | Status: Live | Related Historical Event ID: EV-018 | Sources: Circle Blog USDC Aptos, https://www.circle.com/blog/usdc-now-live-on-aptos (HIGH)
- Integration Name: Tether USDT Native | Integrated With: Tether | Purpose: Native USDT di Aptos. | Status: Live | Related Historical Event ID: EV-018 | Sources: Tether Blog USDT Aptos, https://tether.to/tether-usdt-launches-on-aptos/ (HIGH)

