## Governance Ecosystem
- Foundation: Aptos Foundation | Role: Treasury Management (Community & Endowment Allocation), Grant Programs, Protocol Governance Stewardship, Brand/Trademark | Sources: Aptos Foundation, https://aptosfoundation.org/ (HIGH)
- DAO: On-chain Governance (AIP Process) | Role: Parameter Changes (Inflation, Gas, Validator Set, Upgrades) via 1 APT = 1 Vote | Sources: Governance Forum, https://governance.aptoslabs.com/ (HIGH)
- Council: Validator Set (Top 100-150 by Stake) | Role: Block Production, Consensus Participation, Default Voting Power for Delegators | Sources: Aptos Docs Staking, https://aptos.dev/concepts/staking (HIGH)
- Committee: Aptos Labs (Core Contributors) | Role: Protocol R&D, Client Implementation, Proposal Authorship (Technical), Network Upgrades Execution | Sources: Aptos Labs, https://aptoslabs.com/ (HIGH)
- Committee: Move Language Foundation | Role: Move Language Standard Evolution (Compiler, VM, Prover) | Sources: Move Language Foundation, https://move-language.github.io/move/ (HIGH)

## Ecosystem Risks
- Risiko: Single Infrastructure Dependency (Cloud) | Deskripsi: Proporsi besar validator & RPC bergantung pada Google Cloud & AWS (Centralisasi geografis & penyedia). | Status: Dikonfirmasi (Validator Set Metadata) | Sources: Aptos Explorer Validators, https://explorer.aptoslabs.com/validators (HIGH)
- Risiko: Bridge Dependency (Wormhole / LayerZero) | Deskripsi: Cross-chain liquidity & messaging bergantung sepenuhnya pada keamanan validator/guardian/DVN pihak ketiga (Bukan trust-minimized seperti IBC). | Status: Dikonfirmasi (Arsitektur Bridge) | Sources: Wormhole Docs, https://docs.wormhole.com/; LayerZero Docs, https://layerzero.gitbook.io/docs/ (HIGH)
- Risiko: Oracle Dependency (Pyth / Switchboard) | Deskripsi: DeFi lending/perps bergantung pada price feeds Pyth/Switchboard; tidak ada oracle native enshrined. | Status: Dikonfirmasi (DeFi Integrasi) | Sources: Pyth Aptos, https://pyth.network/developers/price-feed-ids#aptos (HIGH)
- Risiko: Move Language Coupling | Deskripsi: Evolution of Move VM/Compiler bergantung pada Move Language Foundation (External Governance), bukan sepenuhnya internal Aptos. | Status: Dikonfirmasi (Tech Stack) | Sources: Move Language GitHub, https://github.com/move-language/move (HIGH)
- Risiko: Token Concentration (Foundation/Investor/Team) | Deskripsi: >67% supply dikontrol entitas terpusat (Foundation Multi-sig, Investor/Team Vesting Contracts) berisiko governance capture & sell pressure. | Status: Dikonfirmasi (Tokenomics) | Sources: Aptos Tokenomics, https://aptoslabs.com/aptos-tokenomics (HIGH)
- Risiko: Regulatory (US) | Deskripsi: Ketidakpastian status keamanan (Security) token APT mempengaruhi ketersediaan staking/service bagi pengguna/entitas US (Coinbase, Kraken compliance). | Status: Potensial (Industri Luas) | Sources: SEC Enforcement Actions (General), Tidak ada sumber spesifik Aptos. -> **Dicatat sebagai risiko umum industri, bukan konfirmasi spesifik Aptos.**

