## RINGKASAN
- Primary Ecosystem: Move Ecosystem (Layer 1)
- Supported Chains: Aptos Only (Native), Connected via Bridges to 40+ Chains
- External Dependencies: 12 (Move Lang, Wormhole, LayerZero, Google Cloud, AWS, NodeReal, Ankr, QuickNode, Pyth, Switchboard, Circle, Tether)
- Major Integrations: 8 (Wormhole, LayerZero, GCP, AWS, Pyth, Switchboard, Circle USDC, Tether USDT)
- Infrastructure Providers: 8 (NodeReal, Ankr, QuickNode, GCP, AWS, InfStones, Blockdaemon, Figment)
- Developer Programs: 4 SDKs (TS, Py, Rust, Go), 4 APIs (REST, GraphQL, gRPC, Rosetta), CLI, Prover, Analyzer, Grants, Hackathons
- Applications: 13+ Major (Thala, Amnis, Aries, Cellana, PancakeSwap, LiquidSwap, Econia, Ditto, BlueMove, Topaz, ANS, Bridges, Wallets)

## Open Threads
- Daftar lengkap validator set dengan metadata cloud provider (GCP vs AWS vs Bare Metal vs Other) untuk kuantifikasi risiko sentralisasi cloud.
- Status integrasi IBC (Inter-Blockchain Communication) light client di Aptos (Masih proposal/riset vs live) untuk mengurangi dependency bridge trusted.
- Detail SLA & Redundancy RPC Provider resmi (NodeReal, Ankr, QuickNode) vs kebutuhan enterprise.
- Adopsi Native USDC/USDT vs Bridged Version (Wormhole/LayerZero) dalam volume DEFi aktual (Smart Contract Risk).
- Rincian komite teknis (Technical Committee) atau "Security Council" yang berwenang upgrade emergency/hotfix (Multisig threshold) – belum terdokumentasi publik jelas.
- Status grant program "Retroactive Funding" (RetroPGF) atau "Protocol Guild" setara untuk pemelihara core protocol.